That's an artifact of having pissedof Rodney.  Once you wake him up,
you will get zapped by this cursing effect at random.  A couple of
things really help.

1. Get Magicbane and wield it on your climb up.  It deflects those
nasty curses.

2. Make sure you have a sack or oilskin bag. Take things you *know*
you're going to need (=oLev, ?oCharge, etc) and put those along with
your Bag of Holding into the sack.  Being inside a container protects
from the cursing effect.

